		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  Passage de paramètre dynamique dans le Crosstab?]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=28393#p28393"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Erreur de syntaxe:</p><br /><div class="codebox"><pre><code>Caused by: org.postgresql.util.PSQLException: ERROR: Argument of AND must have type boolean, not type sh.invoice</code></pre></div><p>Même avec les parathèse</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>concat($$ SELECT ... WHERE to_char(DateAcct,&#039;YYYY&#039;) = $$ , $P{YEAR}, $$  ORDER BY ... $$
                     AND (Customer_ID= $$ , $P{Customer_ID} , $$ OR $$ ,$P{Customer_ID} IS NULL , $$) ORDER BY ... $$)
 </code></pre></div><br /><p>Cordialement,</p>]]></content>
